{"run_id": "028a30c19f9a438fa3e70ca59dad0514", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T10:58:47.689260+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "fixture_call", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "bm25", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c018", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r018", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十八节 故障处理问答"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 168.75, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 439.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十八节 故障处理问答\n\n问：验证码错误时先做什么？答：检查当前验证码有效性、输入内容及设备时间，仍失败联系服务台。问：可以把验证码和密码一起发给服务台吗？答：不要提供这些凭据，可以提供错误提示和发生时间。\n\n问：换了网络后仍失败怎么办？答：记录网络、时间、错误提示和已排查步骤，联系服务台。问：连接失败能否关闭安全软件试试？答：本文没有授权此类操作，不应自行", "rrf_score": 0.016393, "bm25_score": 3.527269, "vector_score": null}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c004", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r004", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第四条规则边界"], "token_count": 129, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 584.392138671875, 134.51761474609376, 595.850830078125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9997214249202183}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 608.15830078125, 542.300537109375, 657.388134765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9994936534698974}], "snippet": "第四条规则边界\n\n本制度规定提交期限及材料流程，不规定差旅住宿额度、员工借款、外币汇率和付款到账期限。涉及其他制度的事项应读取对应资料，不能将报销提交期限理解为财务处理时限，也不能用资料缺失推定相关费用一律可报。", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 3.488883, "vector_score": null}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c041", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r041", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "注4：城市行、单位、续行和共同注释应合并理解；本表不规定报销提交期限。"], "token_count": 88, "kind": "table_note", "table_id": "table01", "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 634.1953125, 341.25, 642.6953125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "注4：城市行、单位、续行和共同注释应合并理解；本表不规定报销提交期限。", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 3.423374, "vector_score": null}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第五条 报销提交期限"], "token_count": 237, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 157.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 318.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第五条 报销提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后30个自然日。报销申请应提交发票和费用说明。自然日包含周末和节假日，不能直接理解为30个工作日。本文未给出节假日顺延、超期豁免或跨年度延期的批准规则；遇到这些情形时，需要补充制度依据。\n\n申请单应分别记录费用发生日期、实际支付日期、发票开具日期与系统提交日期。不同日期可能不一致，不能为了使申请落在期限内而修改真实日", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 3.385215, "vector_score": null}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第五条提交期限"], "token_count": 212, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 182.91431884765626, 135.7866455078125, 196.494970703125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9998433079038348}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 211.3488037109375, 541.8775390625, 240.6320556640625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998851158789226}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 254.637109375, 542.300537109375, 285.1935546875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989627904362148}], "snippet": "第五条提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后15个自然日。本文未说明适用部门，也未说明是否替代其他报销制度。自然日包括周末和节假日，申请人不应自行改为工作日口径。申请材料应如实列明费用发生日期及提交日期。\n\n本资料未定义首日是否计入、截止时刻以及节假日顺延。若用户要求计算精确的最迟提交日，应先确认这些口径；本文只能支持“费用发生后15个自然日”的原则性表述，不能支", "rrf_score": 0.015385, "bm25_score": 3.147539, "vector_score": null}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十三条期限问答"], "token_count": 223, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 184.18751220703126, 146.36192626953124, 195.64617919921875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986509010195732}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 210.9244140625, 541.454541015625, 256.75908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9981319904327393}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 272.0373046875, 536.801416015625, 302.1693603515625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984620551805239}], "snippet": "第十三条期限问答\n\n问：十五天是工作日吗？答：本文写的是15个自然日，包含周末与节假日。问：财务需要在15天内付款吗？答：15天是申请提交期限，本文没有规定付款时限。问：补开发票后期限重新开始吗？答：本文没有这一规定，不能自动重新起算。\n\n问：超过15天是否绝对不能报？答：本文没有规定超期处置、豁免条件和批准权限，不能推导出绝对结论。问：本制度是否只适用于某", "rrf_score": 0.015152, "bm25_score": 3.113038, "vector_score": null}]}}
